  Docs\PROTOCOL.md:73:
  Docs\PROTOCOL.md:74:**Plan** (`seat: "plan"`): `plannedLines` (per crew: start day, segments with slope from the 
machine rate, holds), `responses[]` (the `pay` options available right now: `key`, `label`, `cost`, `eventTitle`; 
empty when no event is active or forecast), `reportedLines` (actual feet per crew as of the last daily report; never 
today's), `budget` (`budgetUsd`, `spentUsd`, `committedUsd`, `deadlineDay`, `promisedDay`), `inbox[]` (dated items 
from the scenario plus daily reports), `radioLog[]` (orders with status), `catalog` (machines, protection, prices, 
lead days incl. the city delay), `permits` (per zone: `entered: true|false`, `number` if entered; never whether 
entering was wise), `inspections` (per zone: cleared or not), `flags[]` (station, day; no text unless Site typed a 
note), `draft` (ops not yet committed), `uncertainty` (ranges per crew from SR11-style bands; narrows when a report 
lands), `pmLines[]` (text of PM voice lines played so far).
  Docs\PROTOCOL.md:75:
  Docs\PROTOCOL.md:76:**Site** (`seat: "site"`): `truck` (`stationFt`, `moving`, `dismounted`), `crews[]` (`id`, 
`stationFt` live, `working|idle|held|stopped|arguing|demobilized`, `machinePlate` ("Standard"), `moodLevel` 0-3), 
`trench[]` per 100 ft station (`state`: `undug|open|piped|backfilled`, `water: none|seep|standing`, `wall: 
sound|slumped`, `protection: none|box|shoring|slope`, `pipeDamage: none|cracked`), `boards[]` per zone 
(`permitNumber|null`, `inspectionNumber|null`), `sky` (`clear|towersSouth|rain`), `gate` (`trucksWaiting`), 
`activeEvent` (facts only, if Site is within the zone or has inspected it), `orders[]` landed at Site's current 
station awaiting confirmation. No plan, no money, no forecast percentages.
  Docs\PROTOCOL.md:77:
  Docs\PROTOCOL.md:78:**Facilitator** (`seat: "facilitator"`): everything, including hidden variants, pending events 
and deviations, the two other views side by side. Never shown to players; used by Bryan during table tests and by 
Playwright during verification.
